  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>The finish line is in sight. Make a run for it with the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 News. Elevating early 2000s running to modern heights, these silhouettes bring you an outstanding combination of style, technology, and innovation you never knew you needed. The breathable and durable materials keep you comfortable and supported through long runs, while the Zoom Air cushioning ensures a smooth ride. Boasting a richly layered design, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 News will keep you on the radar of competitors and admirers alike.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 News features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Upper mixes synthetic leather for a layered look that‚Äôs built to last.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side enhances support.</li> <li>Ventilation ports on the heel allow breathability and offer a lightweight fit.</li> <li>Metallic accents add a pop of style.</li> <li>Foam midsole enables all-day comfort.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers superior traction and grip. </li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for a sneaker that feels soft, stable, and easy to style. The Nike Zoom Vomero 5 News revives an early-2000s running look with breathable layering, supportive structure, and cushioning that stays comfortable from morning commutes to late-day errands.</p> <ul><li>Mesh and synthetic leather upper creates a layered, breathable look built for everyday wear.</li><li>Plastic side cage adds structure and support.</li><li>Heel ventilation ports help keep the feel light and airy.</li><li>Foam midsole with Zoom Air cushioning delivers all-day comfort.</li><li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the fit feels comfortable and secure right away. For the best fit, we recommend going with your usual size, while shoppers with wider feet, a preference for extra toe room, or who are between sizes may prefer a half-size up.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday walking, commuting, travel days, and casual outfits that still want a sporty edge.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p> <p>Reviewers consistently call out how easy this silhouette is to dress up or down. Its layered Y2K runner design pairs well with leggings, jeans, shorts, and other off-duty looks while staying comfortable for all-day wear.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p> <p>Many wearers say the comfort shows up from the first wear, with little to no break-in needed. For everyday use, the build is widely praised for maintaining its feel and support over time.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p> <p>To keep the layered mesh and synthetic details looking fresh, gentle spot cleaning and air drying are the best approach. Skipping machine washes can help preserve the finish and structure.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 News - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Metallic Silver/Wolf Grey/Summit White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6p